      "description": "Scan for a GitHub issue matching the feature work, then link it or ask — an issue is never created without the BA's permission. Feature work must be linked to a GitHub issue. First find the related work (beans, issues, open PRs) and ask whether to coordinate; then scan before creating, and never create one without the BA's permission — an issue is the stakeholder's record, not the agent's scratchpad.",
